   "form": "Helenả",
   "canon": "elena",
   "who": "Helena Defranceschi, wife of Valentino of Fiume",
   "where": "the FamilySearch index of the Fiume baptisms, XQMQ-HGYH and its fellows",
   "why": "Not a clerk at all — an indexing artefact, a stray hook on the final a. It is why a name search misses her."
  },
